# Video Preview Proxy (v1)

## Modes

| Mode | When | Playback |
|------|------|----------|
| **full** | Proxy ON, no active range | Full proxy MP4, 1:1 frames |
| **range** | Proxy ON + active range | Proxy clip in cached span; source outside |
| **off** | Proxy unchecked | Always source |

Export / ranges / markers: always **source** path and source frame index.

## Cache

- `%LOCALAPPDATA%/MonoStudio/cache/video_proxy/`
- Keys: `{digest}_full_s{scale}.mp4` | `{digest}_r{range_id}_s{scale}.mp4`
- Modules: `monostudio/core/video_proxy_cache.py`, `monostudio/core/video_proxy.py`

## UI

- `QCheckBox` Proxy + `QComboBox` scale (1 · ½ · ¼ · ⅛)
- Esc + proxy ON → **tắt proxy**
- **Scrub + Play** dùng proxy khi cached (ngoài span range = source)
- Ruler: full ready = xanh cả timeline; range = multi-span xanh @ scale; **đang build** = xanh mờ + xanh đậm lan dần theo %
- Clear: preview menu (this video) + Settings → Tools (all)

## mpv

Proxy chỉ đổi `backend.load(playback_path)`. Scrub vẫn `seek()` only — không couple cache layer.
